  "name": "Runemaster Stone Savant: Weapon Engraving: Earth crits grant extra attacks during Earthen Fists (#796)",
  "contract": [
    "Stone Savant 520917 reads 'While Earthen Fists is active, critical strikes with Weapon Engraving: Earth now",
    "causes you to strike twice with your next auto attack.' Its only effect is PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL 520934, an",
    "ADD_EXTRA_ATTACKS effect, but Spell.dbc gives the passive ProcFlags 0, so SpellMgr generates no proc entry and",
    "it never fires. Weapon Engraving: Earth 653272 is a magic-class Nature SCHOOL_DAMAGE spell, the only family 38",
    "spell with mask1 0x20000; Earthen Fists is 806982. Expected: every critical 653272 hit while Earthen Fists is",
    "active casts 520934 once, named as triggered by Stone Savant; without Earthen Fists or without the talent there",
    "is none. The Earth Engraving proc 653221 and Fists of Power 805796 have ProcFlags 0 as well, so 653272 is cast",
    "directly and Earthen Fists is a fixture. The extra swing itself lands on the player's selected target",
    "(Player::SetTarget is a no-op and the harness cannot select a unit), so this case checks the grant, not the",
    "swing. Whether 520934's value 2 (two extra swings) or the tooltip's 'strike twice' is intended is left open."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
